                        "sense_id": "6e0c87d6-656d-3c24-84da-8663ead1f90b",
                        "entry_id": "cb59f573-aa07-3f9c-b72c-579e1ef4a785",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who makes, or is given to making, quotations."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fcbf0c57-e42a-4fe0-aa75-b0e6036f5274",
                                "sense_id": "6e0c87d6-656d-3c24-84da-8663ead1f90b",
                                "text": "Let the ſtatutes of God be turned over, be ſcann'd a new, and conſider'd not altogether by the narrow intellectuals of quotationiſts and common places[.]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3b45b975-375b-4184-9959-56cc2b115354",
                                "sense_id": "6e0c87d6-656d-3c24-84da-8663ead1f90b",
                                "text": "As a quotationist he exceeds Old Burton. Quoting is with him a ‘sine qua nonniness’, a happy term[.]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4e24116a-bcd6-4292-bf80-f5560c03b8ad",
                                "sense_id": "6e0c87d6-656d-3c24-84da-8663ead1f90b",
                                "text": "[W]e conclude that being able to rattle other men's words from the pen's point or tongue's tip, may make a clever quotationist[.]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "92c832a6-ccc3-4b9b-b3f5-a3f70be377a4",
                                "sense_id": "6e0c87d6-656d-3c24-84da-8663ead1f90b",
                                "text": "By-the-by, you great Quotationist, you did not quote Terence rightly."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "06e134d1-b711-4dda-b3a7-8aeac059f90b",
                                "sense_id": "6e0c87d6-656d-3c24-84da-8663ead1f90b",
                                "text": "This chapter is becoming quite quotationist, which is one of Milton's words that didn't catch on."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
